复制赋值的核心代码：
GameBoard& GameBoard::operator=(const GameBoard& rhs) {
    GameBoard temp{rhs};
    swap(temp);
    return *this;
}

交换操作的结构：
void GameBoard::swap(GameBoard& other) noexcept {
    std::swap(m_width, other.m_width);
    std::swap(m_height, other.m_height);
    std::swap(m_cells, other.m_cells);
}
